<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Diamond Multimedia.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Diamond Multimedia.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it downgraded Diamond Multimedia Systems Inc to market perform from buy.</p>
<p>-- On Wednesday, Diamond Multimedia said Wedndesday it expects to post a first quarter operating loss of between $0.12 a share and $0.18 a share on revenues of about $112 million.</p>
<p>-- Diamond Multimedia lost 1-1/2 to seven in early trading.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
